  Running EKF...

  Column definitions:
    Obs#     = observation number (cumulative)
    cumRMSa" = cumulative RMS of altitude residuals (arcsec)
    cumRMSz" = cumulative RMS of azimuth residuals (arcsec)
    winRMSa" = windowed RMS of altitude residuals, last 200 obs (arcsec)
    winRMSz" = windowed RMS of azimuth residuals, last 200 obs (arcsec)
    e_err%   = relative error in eccentricity vs true (%)
    i_err(d) = error in inclination vs true (degrees)
    mu_err%  = relative error in mu vs true (%)
    a_err%   = relative error in semi-major axis vs true (%)
